# boot_motion.expect — stillness-gated boot calibration under handling
# 静止ゲート付き起動校正のハンドリング耐性検証
#
# The chain that must hold: ARM is rejected while the craft is in the hand
# (calibration cannot complete in motion) → after placement the calibration
# completes with a VERIFIED-still window → only then is ARM accepted → normal
# takeoff/hover follows (proving the calibration that resulted is flyable).
# 成立すべき連鎖: 手中では ARM 拒否（動いている間は校正が完了し得ない）→ 設置後に
# 「静止確認済み」窓で校正完了 → その後にのみ ARM 受理 → 通常の離陸/ホバー
# （得られた校正で飛べることの証明）。
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM rejected: boot calibration not complete"
log_contains any "Calibration complete (still window verified"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
order "ARM rejected: boot calibration not complete" "Calibration complete (still window verified"
order "Calibration complete (still window verified" "ARM accepted"
order "ARM accepted" "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
metric tilt_max < 18.0 in [15.5,17.8]
metric duty_max < 0.92 in [15.5,17.8]
